{"id": "EUVD-2026-80600", "enisaUuid": "83104e57-95c0-3be2-b2e2-05489477170e", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncpuidle: dt_idle_genpd: kfree() the original name allocation\n\ndt_idle_pd_alloc() kasprintf()s the full node path, then points\npd->name at kbasename() of that string. dt_idle_pd_free() kfree()s\npd->name, which is no longer the start of the allocation.\n\nCopy the basename instead.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T10:33:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:56:06", "baseScore": 8.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1312ae33b91430ec99e69cd3d47f0e50a4ebf54b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a38caa9ed0d5c61c17d88393b14b292199289c1f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/09d002c8fb0261d35ce9d8a705de5db034ee90b8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b519dfce1998c323e54a56f911cf708d9ba0e076", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3394c7ba23336bdb7ece29127130fd01731d42d8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2b0ac85512b7f67479127b2713254490662eb13d"], "aliases": ["GHSA-6r3p-g4m6-vqrh", "CVE-2026-89992"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "051370ad-0a3d-31e8-aaa5-1c21c810549a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.51"}, {"id": "05cf03f8-03cf-37d1-a407-2e302ac13fe7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "1f769bcd-cd93-3944-85f9-34641d4431fa", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.188"}, {"id": "2bc84407-ae82-31d7-9dac-ddfa638e19a6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "9d976d6721dfb525b81ce981e1363c70c0975aab <1312ae33b91430ec99e69cd3d47f0e50a4ebf54b"}, {"id": "35326877-7673-38f2-a6cd-73e067485fe6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "9d976d6721dfb